{
  "id": "415",
  "title": "Sentence Making",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-12-09",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming needs to create four sentences for his homework.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/595/190a636d93221b2b0523118845cc9d5438346761.mp3?1512499305",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "造句\n\n    小明在写作业。他的作业是“用关联词造句”，要造句的关联词有：一边……一边，要么……要么……，即使……也……，如果……就……。\n    小明想了想，写下了这四个句子：爸爸喜欢一边开车一边看美女。爸爸要么看美女，要么玩手机。即使爸爸再忙，也会看美女。如果这些让妈妈知道了，爸爸就死定了。\n    第二天，老师看到小明造的句子，哭笑不得：句子是对的，可是这该怎么打分呢？",
    "traditional": "造句\n\n    小明在寫作業。他的作業是“用關聯詞造句”，要造句的關聯詞有：一邊……一邊，要麼……要麼……，即使……也……，如果……就……。\n    小明想了想，寫下了這四個句子：爸爸喜歡一邊開車一邊看美女。爸爸要麼看美女，要麼玩手機。即使爸爸再忙，也會看美女。如果這些讓媽媽知道了，爸爸就死定了。\n    第二天，老師看到小明造的句子，哭笑不得：句子是對的，可是這該怎麼打分呢？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Sentence Making"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明在写作业。",
      "traditional": "小明在寫作業。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng zài xiě zuò yè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "他的作业是“用关联词造句”，",
      "traditional": "他的作業是“用關聯詞造句”，",
      "pinyin": "tā de zuò yè shì yòng guān lián cí zào jù",
      "english": "Little Ming was doing homework."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "要造句的关联词有：一边……一边，要么……要么……，即使……也……，如果……就……。",
      "traditional": "要造句的關聯詞有：一邊……一邊，要麼……要麼……，即使……也……，如果……就……。",
      "pinyin": "yào zào jù de guān lián cí yǒu yì biān yì biān yào me yào me jí shǐ yě rú guǒ jiù",
      "english": "His homework was to “create sentences using conjunctions”."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The conjunctions to use were: Doing … while …, Either … or …, Even if … still …, If … then …."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明想了想，写下了这四个句子：",
      "traditional": "小明想了想，寫下了這四個句子：",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiǎng le xiǎng xiě xià le zhè sì ge jù zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "爸爸喜欢一边开车一边看美女。",
      "traditional": "爸爸喜歡一邊開車一邊看美女。",
      "pinyin": "bà ba xǐ huan yì biān kāi chē yì biān kàn měi nǚ",
      "english": "Little Ming thought for a while, and then wrote down these four sentences:"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "爸爸要么看美女，要么玩手机。",
      "traditional": "爸爸要麼看美女，要麼玩手機。",
      "pinyin": "bà ba yào me kàn měi nǚ yào me wán shǒu jī",
      "english": "My dad likes to look at beautiful women when he is driving."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "即使爸爸再忙，也会看美女。",
      "traditional": "即使爸爸再忙，也會看美女。",
      "pinyin": "jí shǐ bà ba zài máng yě huì kàn měi nǚ",
      "english": "My dad either looks at beautiful women, or plays with his phone."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "如果这些让妈妈知道了，爸爸就死定了。",
      "traditional": "如果這些讓媽媽知道了，爸爸就死定了。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ zhè xiē ràng mā ma zhī dào le bà ba jiù sǐ dìng le",
      "english": "Even if my dad is busy, he will still look at beautiful women."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If my mother were to find out, then my dad would be toast."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "第二天，老师看到小明造的句子，哭笑不得：",
      "traditional": "第二天，老師看到小明造的句子，哭笑不得：",
      "pinyin": "dì èr tiān lǎo shī kàn dào xiǎo míng zào de jù zi kū xiào bù dé",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "句子是对的，可是这该怎么打分呢？",
      "traditional": "句子是對的，可是這該怎麼打分呢？",
      "pinyin": "jù zi shì duì de kě shì zhè gāi zěn me dǎ fēn ne",
      "english": "The next day, the teacher saw Little Ming's sentences and didn't know whether to laugh or cry:"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The sentences are correct, but how should she grade them?"
    }
  ],
