    "sentence_translations": [
      "Sentence Making",
      "",
      "Little Ming was doing homework.",
      "His homework was to “create sentences using conjunctions”.",
      "The conjunctions to use were: Doing … while …, Either … or …, Even if … still …, If … then ….",
      "",
      "Little Ming thought for a while, and then wrote down these four sentences:",
      "My dad likes to look at beautiful women when he is driving.",
      "My dad either looks at beautiful women, or plays with his phone.",
      "Even if my dad is busy, he will still look at beautiful women.",
      "If my mother were to find out, then my dad would be toast.",
      "",
      "The next day, the teacher saw Little Ming's sentences and didn't know whether to laugh or cry:",
      "The sentences are correct, but how should she grade them?",
      ""
    ]
  }
